## Feature Goals

### Core Goal
Visualize user click behavior on case study pages.

### Secondary Goals
- Compare engagement across case studies
- Measure which page sections perform best
- Support design and content decisions with behavioral data
- Give admins a clear visual summary without needing to review raw event logs

