## Proposed Scope

### Phase 1 — Click Heatmap
Track and display:
- Click position
- Page URL or case study ID
- Timestamp
- Element type, if available
- Viewport size, if useful for normalization

### Phase 2 — Interaction Context
Expand tracking to include:
- CTA clicks
- Tab or accordion interactions
- Carousel navigation
- Video plays
- Scroll depth by section
- Time spent per section

### Phase 3 — Filtering and Comparison
Allow admins to filter by:
- Case study
- Date range
- Company or industry
- Device type
- Visitor source, if available
- Interaction type

